<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v3"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2676697683"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1796309929"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Resonance of Love"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / 平野綾 / 加藤和樹"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Song Collection from The Rose of Versailles"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:26.730"><div begin="00:14.504" end="04:18.775"><p begin="00:14.504" end="00:28.061" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">運命のようにひそやかに あの夜から動き始めてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切好似般命运悄然而至</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u n me i no yo u ni hi so ya ka ni</span></p><p begin="00:28.947" end="00:35.371" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2">言葉にできぬまま 秘めていた想い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深藏于心的感情 我始终都难以言喻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ni de ki nu ma ma hi me te i ta o mo i</span></p><p begin="00:35.571" end="00:39.232" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3">熱いときめきを 交わそう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让热情与悸动交织起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a tsu i to ki me ki wo ka wa so u</span></p><p begin="00:39.439" end="00:45.591" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4">愛しい あなただけ見つめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心凝视着我所珍爱的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to shi i a na ta da ke mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="00:47.104" end="00:50.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I’ll hold you tight and never let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会紧紧地将你拥在怀里 永远不会放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'll hold you tight and never let you go</span></p><p begin="00:50.763" end="00:55.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">惹かれ合う心 抱きとめていたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两颗心相互吸引 渴望将当下这瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka re a u ko ko ro da ki to me te i ta i</span></p><p begin="00:55.278" end="01:01.435" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">今この瞬間(とき)だけを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牢牢地铭记在心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ko no to ki da ke wo</span></p><p begin="01:01.742" end="01:05.350" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L8">And hold me tight to never let me go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你也同样紧拥着我 永远都不放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">And hold me tight to never let me go</span></p><p begin="01:05.350" end="01:09.743" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L9">呼び合う鼓動 確かめ合いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此呼唤的悸动 让我想与你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo bi a u ko do u ta shi ka me a i ta i</span></p><p begin="01:09.743" end="01:13.762" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L10">あふれる喜びを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">确认这满溢的欣喜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re ru yo ro ko bi wo</span></p><p begin="01:14.562" end="01:18.725" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L11">Be honest just for now with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿你此刻坦诚相待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Be honest just for now</span></p><p begin="01:18.725" end="01:20.901" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L12">With me, with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样与我相依相伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">With me with me with me</span></p><p begin="01:21.668" end="01:28.537" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L13">ほとばしる この胸の高鳴りよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悸动的感觉迸发在我的心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho to ba shi ru ko no mu ne no ta ka na ri yo</span></p><p begin="01:28.951" end="01:32.415" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L14">Be honest just for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿你此刻坦诚相待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Be honest just for now</span></p><p begin="01:32.415" end="01:35.812" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L15">噛み締めるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能认真品味</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi shi me ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:36.112" end="01:45.899" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L16">二人だけの真実だろうと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只属于你我的真相吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri da ke no shi n ji tsu da ro u to</span></p><p begin="01:49.049" end="02:02.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">最後の恋と決めたとき迷いは消えた 霧が晴れたように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认定这是此生最后的爱恋时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no ko i to ki me ta to ki</span></p><p begin="02:03.584" end="02:09.981" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">日々のひとつひとつが 輝き始めた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经的岁月开始一点一点绽放璀璨光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi no hi to tsu hi to tsu ga ka ga ya ki ha ji me ta</span></p><p begin="02:10.181" end="02:13.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">美しい記憶を刻もう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">铭刻下美好的回忆吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu ku shi i ki o ku wo ki za mo u</span></p><p begin="02:13.949" end="02:20.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">愛しいあなただけ見つめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼中只看得到我所珍爱的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to shi i a na ta da ke mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="02:21.634" end="02:25.338" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21">I’ll hold you tight and never let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会紧紧地将你拥在怀里 永远不会放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'll hold you tight and never let you go</span></p><p begin="02:25.338" end="02:29.701" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22">震える身体 抱きとめていたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望在当下这瞬间将你颤抖的身体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru ka ra da da ki to me te i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:29.701" end="02:35.127" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23">今この瞬間(とき)だけは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧地拥在我怀中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ko no to ki da ke ha</span></p><p begin="02:36.210" end="02:39.917" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L24">And hold me tight to never let me go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你也同样紧拥着我 永远都不放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">And hold me tight to never let me go</span></p><p begin="02:39.917" end="02:44.267" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L25">くちびる重ね 分かち合いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">缠绵亲吻 就连夺眶而出的泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku chi bi ru ka sa ne wa ka chi a i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:44.267" end="02:48.589" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L26">あふれる涙さえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想与你一同分享</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re ru na mi da sa e</span></p><p begin="02:48.969" end="02:53.278" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L27">Be honest just for now with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿你此刻坦诚相待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Be honest just for now</span></p><p begin="02:53.278" end="02:55.319" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L28">With me, with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样与我相依相伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">With me with me with me</span></p><p begin="02:56.268" end="03:02.921" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L29">燃え上がる この甘き情熱よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让这份甜蜜的热情灼灼燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo e a ga ru ko no a ma ki jo u ne tsu yo</span></p><p begin="03:03.445" end="03:06.889" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L30">Be honest just for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿你此刻坦诚相待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Be honest just for now</span></p><p begin="03:06.889" end="03:10.342" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L31">沁み渡るように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能刻骨铭心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi mi wa ta ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:10.765" end="03:17.898" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L32">たとえ嵐が吹き荒れても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕暴风雨将会肆虐而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e a ra shi ga fu ki a re te mo</span></p><p begin="03:17.998" end="03:21.347" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L33">The resonance of love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意就此产生共鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">The resonance of love</span></p><p begin="03:21.547" end="03:24.651" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L34">全て預けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此交付一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te a zu ke te</span></p><p begin="03:25.272" end="03:31.960" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L35">愛を誓おう 溶け合いながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许下爱的誓言 就此融为一体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i wo chi ka o u to ke a i na ga ra</span></p><p begin="03:32.648" end="03:35.776" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L36">The resonance of love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意就此产生共鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">The resonance of love</span></p><p begin="03:36.147" end="03:39.307" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L37">染められていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">染上斑斓的色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so me ra re te i ku</span></p><p begin="03:39.936" end="03:46.534" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L38">過去と未来が混ざり合うように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过去与未来仿佛将要糅混在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ko to mi ra i ga ma za ri a u yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:47.195" end="03:49.710" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L39">The resonance of love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意就此产生共鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">The resonance of love</span></p><p begin="04:01.784" end="04:04.373" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L40">The resonance of love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意就此产生共鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">The resonance of love</span></p><p begin="04:05.340" end="04:07.916" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L41">全て預けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此交付一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te a zu ke te</span></p><p begin="04:09.025" end="04:18.775" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L42">愛を誓おう 泡沫(うたかた)のようなひとときでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许下爱的誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i wo chi ka o u</span></p></div></body></tt>